{"schemaVersion":2,"id":"meetdeet-2005-deet-science2-20","exam":"MEET_DEET","year":2005,"subject":"chemistry","number":20,"points":null,"unitId":"stereo","unitLabel":"유기 구조·입체화학","topic":"E)","classificationStatus":"keyword-candidate-unverified","classificationCandidates":["stereo","nomenclature"],"stem":"다음은선형포화탄화수소계열화합물들의화학식과명칭을\n나타낸것이다.\n탄소수\n화학식\n명\n칭\n2\nCH3CH3\n에테인(ethane)\n4\nCH3CH2CH2CH3\n뷰테인(butane)\n6\nCH3CH2CH2CH2CH2CH3\n헥세인(hexane)\n⋮\n⋮\n⋮\n⋮\n⋮\n⋮\n―\n―\n2n\n( CH2－CH2 ) n\n폴리에틸렌(PE, n>1,000)\n위화합물들의성질에관한설명중옳은것을<보기>에서모두\n고른것은?\n<보기>\nㄱ. 분자간인력은분산력(dispersion force)이다.\nㄴ. 탄소수증가에따라순차적으로기체, 액체, 고체가된다.\nㄷ. 폴리에틸렌용액에서는빛의경로가보이는틴달현상을\n관찰할수없다.\nㄹ. n이서로다른폴리에틸렌을같은질량만큼녹인용액의\n삼투압은n이클수록낮다.","stemTextItemIds":["t001","t002","t003","t004","t005","t006","t007","t008","t009","t010","t011","t012","t013","t014","t015","t016","t017","t018","t019","t020","t021","t022","t023","t024","t025","t026","t027","t028","t029","t030","t031","t032","t033","t034","t035"],"stemAssetIds":["fig-01","fig-02","fig-03","fig-04"],"options":[{"number":1,"text":"ㄱ, ㄴ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t036"]},{"number":2,"text":"ㄱ, ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t037"]},{"number":3,"text":"ㄴ, ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t038"]},{"number":4,"text":"ㄷ, ㄹ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t039"]},{"number":5,"text":"ㄱ, ㄴ, ㄹ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t040"]}],"answer":null,"acceptedAnswers":[],"answerStatus":"untranscribed","assets":[{"id":"fig-01","width":762,"height":6,"region":0,"bbox":[14.355,46.69,304.8,2.4],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":[],"src":"/mdeet/assets/meetdeet-2005-deet-science2-20/01.webp"},{"id":"fig-02","width":761,"height":6,"region":0,"bbox":[14.755,66.29,304.4,2.4],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":[],"src":"/mdeet/assets/meetdeet-2005-deet-science2-20/02.webp"},{"id":"fig-03","width":761,"height":6,"region":0,"bbox":[14.755,175.09,304.4,2.4],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":[],"src":"/mdeet/assets/meetdeet-2005-deet-science2-20/03.webp"},{"id":"fig-04","width":765,"